This release collects existing project-generated Crucibles game kernels,
their original mechanism descriptions and declarative scene metadata.
Per-file origin and SHA-256 values are retained in each game's provenance.json.
Historical author status wording is retained as provenance rather than rewritten
as a claim about the release's current verification.

The agent-keyed facade and documentation organization reference JaxMARL:
https://github.com/bold-lab-ai/JaxMARL
https://jaxmarl.foersterlab.com/
